  "solution": "Ta đặt hệ trục tọa độ như sau<br><div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a58f05183085f2ed914d4db61a56e1bf77c135df59a5178c8877d76f0579cfbf.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là độ dài trục lớn của elip nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math>;<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là một nửa trục bé nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy phương trình của elip có hình mái vòm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Gọi điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> là điểm cách chân tường <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> m khi đó khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> đến gốc tọa độ là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math> m.<br>Vậy ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> (với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>) thỏa mãn phương trình elip nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
